            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Your Shooting Phase</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">If this unit used a **^^Shoot^^** ability this turn and all of its attacks targeted the same enemy unit, that enemy unit is the target.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice and add the number of enemy models in the target unit slain by attacks made by this unit this turn. If the result is 6+, the target has **^^Strike-last^^** for the rest of the turn.</characteristic>
