            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If this unit is in combat with any enemy **^^Heroes^^**, it can use 2 **^^Fight^^** abilities this phase. After the first is used, however, this unit has **^^Strike-last^^** for the rest of the phase and can only be picked to use a second **^^Fight^^** ability if it is still in combat with any enemy **^^Heroes^^**.</characteristic>
